title: Ambient light exposure analysis in epilepsy using NHANES
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jake
    family-names: Ahern
    email: jake.ahern@plymouth.ac.uk
    affiliation: University of Plymouth
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # TODO
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahernj/ambient_light_epilepsy_analysis"  # TODO: confirm
abstract: >-
  Analysis of ambient light exposure and nonparametric circadian rhythm metrics in
  people with epilepsy compared with frequency-matched controls, using wrist-worn
  light sensor and accelerometry recordings from the NHANES 2011-2012 and 2013-2014
  cycles.
keywords:
  - epilepsy
  - circadian rhythm
  - ambient light exposure
  - actigraphy
  - NHANES
